1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,529
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,529 --> 00:00:02,531
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:04,149
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:06,424
Hello!

5
00:00:06,974 --> 00:00:09,899
Today we're visiting the farm!

6
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:13,649
Look! It's a cow.

7
00:00:14,149 --> 00:00:15,547
Cow!

8
00:00:16,097 --> 00:00:18,197
What does the cow say?

9
00:00:19,597 --> 00:00:21,197
Moo!

10
00:00:21,747 --> 00:00:23,997
The cow gives us milk.

11
00:00:25,697 --> 00:00:27,572
Who is this?

12
00:00:29,372 --> 00:00:31,223
It's a sheep!

13
00:00:31,773 --> 00:00:33,848
What does the sheep say?

14
00:00:35,248 --> 00:00:37,223
Baa, baa!

15
00:00:37,773 --> 00:00:40,598
The sheep has soft, fluffy wool.

16
00:00:42,298 --> 00:00:44,473
Look! It's a pig.

17
00:00:44,973 --> 00:00:46,423
Pig!

18
00:00:46,973 --> 00:00:49,048
What does the pig say?

19
00:00:50,448 --> 00:00:52,298
Oink, oink!

20
00:00:52,848 --> 00:00:55,723
The pig loves to roll in the mud.

21
00:00:57,423 --> 00:00:59,473
Look! It's a horse.

22
00:00:59,973 --> 00:01:01,448
Horse!

23
00:01:01,998 --> 00:01:04,073
What does the horse say?

24
00:01:05,473 --> 00:01:07,023
Neigh!

25
00:01:07,573 --> 00:01:10,198
The horse can run very fast.

26
00:01:11,898 --> 00:01:13,773
Who is this?

27
00:01:15,573 --> 00:01:17,448
It's a duck!

28
00:01:17,998 --> 00:01:19,998
What does the duck say?

29
00:01:21,398 --> 00:01:23,323
Quack, quack!

30
00:01:23,873 --> 00:01:26,373
The duck swims in the pond.

31
00:01:28,073 --> 00:01:30,198
Look! It's a hen.

32
00:01:30,698 --> 00:01:32,222
Hen!

33
00:01:32,772 --> 00:01:34,872
What does the hen say?

34
00:01:36,272 --> 00:01:38,247
Cluck, cluck!

35
00:01:38,797 --> 00:01:40,997
The hen lays eggs.

36
00:01:42,697 --> 00:01:44,847
Look! It's a little chick.

37
00:01:45,347 --> 00:01:46,623
Chick!

38
00:01:47,173 --> 00:01:49,223
What does the chick say?

39
00:01:50,623 --> 00:01:52,573
Cheep, cheep!

40
00:01:54,273 --> 00:01:56,148
Who is this?

41
00:01:57,948 --> 00:01:59,897
It's a dog!

42
00:02:00,447 --> 00:02:02,547
What does the dog say?

43
00:02:03,947 --> 00:02:05,797
Woof, woof!

44
00:02:06,347 --> 00:02:08,947
The dog helps on the farm.

45
00:02:10,647 --> 00:02:13,495
Now let's play a memory game!

46
00:02:14,045 --> 00:02:15,634
Do you remember?

47
00:02:15,634 --> 00:02:16,720
Let's see!

48
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:20,320
What is this?

49
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,919
Cow!

50
00:02:24,469 --> 00:02:26,769
Yes! Well done!

51
00:02:28,469 --> 00:02:30,369
What is this?

52
00:02:32,569 --> 00:02:33,869
Sheep!

53
00:02:34,419 --> 00:02:36,369
That's right!

54
00:02:38,069 --> 00:02:39,969
What is this?

55
00:02:42,169 --> 00:02:43,619
Pig!

56
00:02:44,169 --> 00:02:46,194
Great job!

57
00:02:47,894 --> 00:02:49,794
What is this?

58
00:02:51,994 --> 00:02:53,469
Horse!

59
00:02:54,019 --> 00:02:55,994
You got it!

60
00:02:57,694 --> 00:02:59,594
What is this?

61
00:03:01,794 --> 00:03:03,119
Duck!

62
00:03:03,669 --> 00:03:05,369
Super!

63
00:03:07,069 --> 00:03:08,969
What is this?

64
00:03:11,169 --> 00:03:12,693
Hen!

65
00:03:13,243 --> 00:03:14,893
Hooray!

66
00:03:16,593 --> 00:03:18,493
What is this?

67
00:03:20,693 --> 00:03:21,968
Chick!

68
00:03:22,518 --> 00:03:24,818
Yes! Well done!

69
00:03:26,518 --> 00:03:28,418
What is this?

70
00:03:30,618 --> 00:03:32,117
Dog!

71
00:03:32,667 --> 00:03:34,617
That's right!

72
00:03:36,317 --> 00:03:39,343
Wow! You remembered everything!

73
00:03:41,193 --> 00:03:43,843
You are a super learner!

74
00:03:45,543 --> 00:03:48,492
We met all the farm animals!

75
00:03:49,042 --> 00:03:51,842
Great job, little learner!

76
00:03:52,392 --> 00:03:54,343
Share Mimzi with a friend,

77
00:03:54,343 --> 00:03:56,967
and subscribe for more learning fun!

78
00:03:57,517 --> 00:03:58,588
Next time,

79
00:03:58,588 --> 00:04:01,142
let's meet the wild animals.

80
00:04:01,392 --> 00:04:03,118
Bye bye!
